12. `CHANGELOG.md` — entry

Check engine.cpp around line 120-130 for newConcatConv default to mimic. And check where engine.h lists class forward declarations (already saw: `class ImageCopy;` at top). Add `class TemporalAccum;`.

Also `core/CMakeLists.txt` — check if it lists headers (image_copy.h listed?). Let me check core/CMakeLists.txt sources.

For execute(): the temporalAccum op needs cur = outputTemp. But note outputTemp only exists when allocated. With temporal enabled I'll force outputTemp allocation.

One subtlety: `outputTempDesc(output->getFormat(), W, H)` — fine.

